title: CastleExteriorReveal
---
Molly: What the heck?!
King's Ghost: Young lady, I think it would be for the best if you came back inside.
Molly: You're...not going to hurt me?
King's Ghost: Absolutely not. Why would I want to hurt you?
Molly: Isn't that what ghosts do? Try to haunt people and scare them to death?
King's Ghost: I assure you that far from my intentions. Perhaps it would be prudent if we dispensed with introductions first?
Molly: Sure... I guess.
King's Ghost: I am the king of Aethelgard, 20th of my line. Protector of all and ruler of the land. You may call me his Royal Majesty King... king... err...
Molly: King, what?
King's Ghost: Oh my. I seem to have forgotten my own name. How puzzling!
Molly: Well what should I call you then? King's Ghost:? 
King's Ghost: This is so frustrating. I simply cannot recall. It is just gone!
King's Ghost: Perhaps we should start with your name instead?
Molly: Fine. My name is Molly. First of my line, I think? Protector of not much and collector of comic books. 
Molly: And also very confused, for different reasons.
King's Ghost: Well I happy to meet you, young Molly. Why don't we go inside and I can explain everything as best I can?
Molly: Ok...
===